# Seamless Login via URL Payload

The goal is to provide a way to log a user in directly via a URL containing `UserName`, `Token`, and `timestamp`, bypassing the OTP verification step. **Per your request, we will not modify or break any existing functions in the current code.** We will strictly **add** new methods to handle this payload, while reusing existing session-creation logic inside the new method.

